<h2>Where grade-specification mistakes cost buyers money</h2>
<p><strong>Ordering on a cP number without a method.</strong> A contract that says "5000 cps minimum" and nothing else invites a dispute. Our certificate may show an overnight reading while the receiving lab reads soon after mixing, or at a different concentration or spindle speed, and the lot "fails" without anything being wrong with it. Write concentration, temperature, instrument, spindle, speed and hydration time into the purchase order, and agree which laboratory's result governs.</p>
<p><strong>Using a food-grade specification to buy an oilfield product, or the reverse.</strong> A frac buyer who asks for "food grade" pays for tests and hygiene controls the well doesn't need, and may still get a powder that hydrates too slowly. A food manufacturer who buys the cheaper industrial lot to save money has a product with no microbiology, heavy-metal or purity evidence behind it. That is a recall risk, not a saving.</p>
<p><strong>Assuming moisture on the certificate is moisture at arrival.</strong> Guar gum picks up water from humid air. A lot packed well inside its moisture limit can arrive above it if bags were damaged or stored open, and extra water both adds weight you pay freight on and changes how the powder hydrates. Check liners and bag seals at loading and on arrival.</p>
<p><strong>Accepting "200 mesh" as a name.</strong> Without a percentage passing, one mill's 200 mesh can hold enough coarse particles to form lumps in a food mixer or slow the gel build on a frac blender. Ask for the particle-size distribution on the certificate.</p>
<p><strong>Forgetting the EU paperwork.</strong> An EU food shipment without the SHEFEXIL-endorsed PCP report can be held at the border. Tell us the destination at enquiry so the test is scheduled before loading, not after.</p>
<p><strong>Skipping the pre-shipment sample.</strong> For a first order or a new grade, approve a sample drawn from the production lot and test it in your own application. It costs a few days and prevents most of the problems above.</p>
